# Netlify redirects for jirehcooler.com.
#
# Canonical production host is https://www.jirehcooler.com (see astro.config.mjs
# `site` and src/components/Seo.astro `siteUrl`). This rule only takes effect
# once the apex domain is actually pointed at this Netlify site — inert until
# then, and one-directional only (apex -> www), so it cannot create a loop
# with any www -> apex rule.
https://jirehcooler.com/*  https://www.jirehcooler.com/:splat  301!

